---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.author}.`}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about">
      <div class="kicker">About</div>
      <h1>Linying Li</h1>
      <blockquote class="epigraph">
        求之于心而是也，虽其言之出于庸常，不敢以为非也；<br/>
        求之于心而非也，虽其言之出于孔子，不敢以为是也。
      </blockquote>
      <p class="about__lede">
        Trained in political science at LMU Munich and the University of
        Zurich. My research sits between political economy and political
        theory, with an empirical leaning toward computational text
        analysis. The essays on this site are where the reading turns
        into writing.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Short bio</h2>
        <p>
          I read for a BA in Political Science and Law at LMU Munich
          (2019–2022) and an MA in Political Science at the University of
          Zurich (2022–2024), specialising in Political Economy and
          Philosophy. My BA thesis worked through Jürgen Habermas on
          deliberative democracy, and Habermas remains the theorist I
          most often return to.
        </p>

        <p>
          My methodological training has tried to keep quantitative and
          qualitative tools in conversation: econometrics and
          causal-inference designs on one side, Qualitative Comparative
          Analysis on the other, and a fair amount of text-as-data work
          with transformer models. The MA thesis that came out of all
          this used BERTopic and a fine-tuned BERT model to study
          political discourse on YouTube around income inequality
          (<a href="/MasterThesis.pdf">full text, PDF</a>).
        </p>

      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Selected writing</h2>
        <p>
          Browse by section:
          <a href="/categories/economics/">Economics</a>,
          <a href="/categories/politics/">Politics</a>,
          <a href="/categories/international-relations/">International Relations</a>.
          The full list lives in the <a href="/archive/">archive</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Email —
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.authorEmail}`}>{SITE.authorEmail}</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            GitHub —
            <a href={`https://github.com/${SITE.githubUser}`}>
              @{SITE.githubUser}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>RSS — <a href="/rss.xml">/rss.xml</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
